<title>USA: U.S. meat output 1.5 pct below a week ago - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. meat output 1.5 pct below a week ago - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Red meat production for week ending Saturday, March 22, fell 1.5 at 790.9 million lbs. - USDA</p>
<p>WEEK ENDING/1  BEEF   CALF/VEAL   PORK/2 LAMB/MUTTON TOTALS/3</p>
<p>22-Mar-97	443.3     6.6	334.7     6.3	 790.9</p>
<p>15-Mar-97	455.0     6.7	334.7     6.3	 802.7</p>
<p>Change:	   -2.6%   -1.5%	 0.0%    0.0%	-1.5%</p>
<p>23-Mar-96	478.7     7.0	329.0     6.5	 821.2</p>
<p>Change:	   -7.4%   -5.7%	 1.7%   -3.1%	-3.7%</p>
<p>1997 YTD:     5440.2    75.1     3730.9    58.6	9304.8</p>
<p>1996 YTD:     5717.2    81.3     3985.5    65.2	9849.2</p>
<p>Change:	   -4.9%   -7.6%	-6.4%  -10.1%	-5.5%</p>
